          <details class="wapp__fineprint">
            <summary>Good to know before you use Swings</summary>
            <ul>
              <li><strong>Your wallet signs everything.</strong> Aretia never holds your keys or your money.</li>
              <li><strong>You see the cost first.</strong> The quote, the least you will receive and every fee are shown before anything is signed.</li>
              <li><strong>Quotes are not promises.</strong> Prices move, and a quote runs out after a short time.</li>
              <li><strong>Big trades in small pools can be sandwiched.</strong> Swaps are not sent through a protected route.</li>
              <li><strong>A coin being listed is not a recommendation.</strong> Check the safety notes and the address before you buy.</li>
              <li>The swap window marks any network that is switched off.</li>
