            </form>
            <div data-shield-result aria-live="polite"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="wapp__card">
            <span class="wapp__eyebrow">What Shield can and cannot tell you</span>
            <ul class="wapp__list">
              <li>It reads the account straight from a public Solana RPC. The address you check is sent to that RPC, and nowhere else.</li>
              <li>"No risks found" means nothing unusual was seen. It does not mean the address is safe. Confirm it with the recipient another way.</li>
