            <p class="wapp__banner wapp__banner--warn"><b>Not live.</b> This is sandbox software running on simulated data. No carbon registry is a customer, partner or approver of this work, nothing here is a real carbon credit, and it has not been audited. ACT is a separate token and is not a carbon credit.</p>
